{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53191","headline":"诗偈 十六 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无贪胜布施，无痴胜坐禅。\n无瞋胜持戒，无念胜求缘。\n尽见（《祖堂集》卷十五作「现」）凡夫事，夜来安乐眠。\n寒时向火坐，火本实（《祖堂集》作「寔本」）无烟。\n不忌（《祖堂集》作「怕」）黑闇女，不求功德天。\n任运生方便，皆同般若船。\n若能如是学，功德实无边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}